# Deploy

## GitHub
- Source: `hackmods/david-dj-roy` (`origin`)
- Live Pages: `DavidDJRoy/DavidDJRoy.github.io` (`pages`) — push `main` to publish
- Workflow: `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` — validate + CapRover tarball on `main` (optional; needs CapRover secrets)
- CapRover needs secrets: `CAPROVER_SERVER`, `CAPROVER_APP_NAME`, plus token or password
- App name example: `david-dj-roy`

See `docs/DEPLOY-GITHUB-PAGES.md`.

## Docker / CapRover image
- `captain-definition` → `Dockerfile` (nginx:alpine)
- Copy static assets including `robots.txt`, `sitemap.xml`, `404.html`, and `img/`
